# TrumpRx guide: a static page, served under the same /es/ convention as
# every other Spanish URL. The old /trumprx-es address permanently moves —
# forced, because /trumprx-es resolves to the static trumprx-es.html and a
# non-forced rule would be skipped in favor of serving that file.
/es/trumprx  /trumprx-es.html  200
/trumprx-es  /es/trumprx  301!

# English-only pages (partner and sales surfaces with no Spanish
# translation) never answer under /es/: the shell there is lang="es", so
# the English copy would be read in a Spanish voice and indexed under a
# Spanish URL. Send them to the English page. Must precede the /es/* shell.
/es/for-hospitals  /for-hospitals  301
/es/pricing  /pricing  301

